  "initialFindings": [
    "The original supervisor failed both deterministic custody regression cases by disappearing before descendant settlement.",
    "The shutdown-observation regression failed on the intermediate implementation: a fast parent could exit before periodic observation captured its tool. The final runtime samples ancestry before EOF.",
    "The initial auto-review canary incorrectly required another tick after the build tick had completed automatic review; the corrected final canaries passed.",
    "One suite run raced a 350ms sleep in held.test.ts; the test now waits for causal state transitions with bounded deadlines."
  ],
  "releaseLimitations": [
    "The existing live controller and schema52 database have not been replaced; macOS Documents access remains an unresolved deployment gate.",
    "The migration used a consistent private snapshot, not the live database.",
    "The desktop canary used an isolated temporary project and explicit LaunchAgent activation, not the protected Documents projects or a physical logout/reboot.",
    "macOS process containment remains observational; native containment is covered separately by Linux cgroup and Windows Job Object CI."
  ]
